        <h1>Social Media for DTC Brands in 2026: What Works</h1>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <span>By <a href="/about/"><strong>Kevin Freeland</strong></a></span>
          <span>March 12, 2026</span>
          <span>8 min read</span>
        </div>
